---
intent: >
  Refine init's confirmation model to silent-on-create, prompt-on-overwrite.
  Introduce a fourth status `would-overwrite` computed by byte comparison, add
  `"overwritten"` to the apply manifest, and update every category helper plus
  the orchestrator prompt so pure-create categories apply silently while
  overwrite-bearing categories pause with AskUserQuestion.
---

